== 3.2 shuffled-CF control: same partial-quotient multiset, shuffled order ==
   fitted cubic in theta on the 18 EXPLORE slopes; residual sd: U_var 0.0034, U_loc 0.0059
   built 16 shuffled-CF slopes (same multiset, different order -> different theta)
   deviation of shuffled-CF slopes from the EXPLORE theta-curve:
      U_var: mean +0.0071, sd 0.0219, max|dev| 0.0827
      U_loc: mean -0.0022, sd 0.0125, max|dev| 0.0343
   -> shuffling the CF (which changes Diophantine type but keeps the multiset) moves the
      statistics only along the theta-curve; the curve itself is unchanged.
